abstract: "An independently authored Proof Protocol mapping connecting the Colorado Artificial Intelligence Act (SB 24-205, as repealed and reenacted by SB 26-189) developer and deployer obligations to evidence, efficacy measurements, and proof artifacts, keeping non-empirical obligations distinct. A Proof Protocol result is not a legal or regulatory determination."
